# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# FILES TO COMMIT (kept intentionally — do not add these to ignore patterns)
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# Core pipeline
#   extract_features.py       — parses .mat files, builds feature CSVs
#   train_switch_model.py     — trains XGBoost on GR010, saves model_switch.json
#   predict_gr011.py          — runs trained model on GR011, outputs predictions
#   embed_predictions.py      — bakes predictions into index.html
#   run_daily.py              — unified daily pipeline (auto-detects new .mat files)
#   daily_monitor.py          — prints experimenter flags for latest session
#   append_future_session.py  — appends one future-session CSV for demo testing
#   generate_demo_data.py     — generates synthetic GR011 data + future sessions
#
# Legacy / reference (keep for comparison)
#   train_model.py            — original mastery-% model, superseded by train_switch_model.py
#
# Diagnostic scripts (safe to delete once no longer needed)
#   diagnose_modality.py
#   diagnose_modality2.py
#   diagnose_rt.py
#
# Web
#   index.html                — public-facing single-file website
#   dashboard.html            — lab-use dashboard (loads CSVs via file picker)
#
# Repo hygiene
#   .gitignore